      "hero_headline": "Build AI Agents. Connect Tools. Get Work Done.",
      "hero_lead": "Give every agent its role, its rules and its system prompt in a console that only listens on 127.0.0.1. Attach any OpenAI-compatible model endpoint, let the built-in 24/7 agent read intent and propose meetings, and let one bot borrow a read-only capability from another inside the same process. Keys, ledger and audit stay on your disk, and every permanent POPOPX address points back to you.",
      "hero_sub": "Create a bot, get its permanent address, then let rules answer, forward enquiries to your support group and open a ticket per customer. Everything runs on loopback, nothing is bundled.",
      "hero_tag_1": "Zero metadata",
      "hero_tag_2": "100% self-hosted",
      "hero_tag_3": "One-command deploy",
