      "hero_title": "A bot factory for the identity-less messenger",
      "int_1_d": "POST to {base_url}/chat/completions with a Bearer key. Any vendor that speaks the OpenAI shape works; the default is Ollama on 127.0.0.1:11434, and a per-bot switch refuses anything but loopback.",
      "int_1_t": "OpenAI-compatible model endpoint",
      "int_2_d": "Inbound alerts become messages; outbound callbacks carry an HMAC-SHA256 signature with an auto-generated secret. Targets are restricted to https or to loopback http.",
      "int_2_t": "Signed webhooks in and out",
      "int_3_d": "getMe, sendMessage, setWebhook and getUpdates under /api/v1 on the same loopback port as the console, addressed by bot token.",
      "int_3_t": "Telegram-shaped Open API",
      "int_4_d": "Five built-in plugins on one priority chain, the 24/7 personal agent included, with room for your own module that replies, forwards or stays silent.",
      "int_4_t": "Plugin bus",
      "int_5_d": "Not implemented: Needle 3 can extract one of five read-only tool intents from a sentence, but nothing executes a tool on the model's own authority. A tool runs because a rule, a plugin or your own code invokes it.",
      "int_5_t": "Model-initiated tool calling",
      "int_headline": "What plugs in, and how",
